          "completes": false,
          "sceneImage": "public/art/scenes/locations/auditorium.bmp"
        },
        {
          "id": "done",
          "title": "地下室的帮忙",
          "text": "地下室已经打扫完了。刚才的遭遇，你决定暂且不提。",
          "outcome": "completed",
          "completes": true,
          "sceneImage": "public/art/scenes/locations/auditorium.bmp"
